,"kind":"update","title":"Update 0.1.5 Meta Progression & Release of Final Demo","summary":"Final Demo is Complete! We are excited to announce that the final demo is officially complete! This update comes packed with new features like achievements, permanent upgrades, and numerous quality-of-life improvements. After three months of dedicated playtesting and gathering player feedback, we’ve crafted a demo that reflects the community’s input. Your suggestions truly shaped the game, and I’ve done my best to integrate everything you asked for. The Meta Progression Project This is the large","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-09-07T13:35:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/6242640076604076688","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2950400-5963413728339514386","game_id":"steam-2950400","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.1.4","summary":"Exciting New Updates! Level Completion Screen: After finishing a level, you'll now see a stats screen showing how you did and what achievements you collected. Level Replay: From the main menu, you can now access the level selection screen to replay any level you've completed. Achievement Tracker: In the level selection screen, you can view the achievements you've earned and see which ones you're still missing for each level. Weapon Upgrades: Weapon damage scaling has been increased, making it mu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-08-02T18:00:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5963413728339514386","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2950400-5842939267338750345","game_id":"steam-2950400","kind":"announcement","title":"0.1.2","summary":"It has been more than a month since the release of the Equiverse demo! Equiverse has over 400 wishlists and the Disord community has been growing in number and into a positive and constructive environment. I tried to listen to all the feedback as much as possible and like to show this to you in another Quality of life update! Check out the list of improvements below! Camera movement is now adjustable through the options menu when in a level (You can adjust camera speed and inversion) Pablo flies","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-07-05T13:28:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5842939267338750345","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2950400-5746109972552819937","game_id":"steam-2950400","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.1.1","summary":"Quality of life changes and small bug fixes A lot of people have been playing Equiverse and I couldn't be happier with the positive feedback it received! A week ago I released the demo and I have tried to listen to all the feedback I got. To celebrate the success of the demo in the first week I wanted to update the game and already implement some of the feedback! Here is a list Quality of life From level 1-2, players get more starting Leafpoints to speed up the early game. Added How to play tuto","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-06-07T15:14:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5746109972552819937","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2950400":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:38Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:38Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2950400":"2026-10-26T10:14:38Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2950400":{"last_attempt_at